# Qt MQTT: the MQTT 5 parser fixes Qt made in August 2026 for 6.8 and later,
# CVE-2026-107457 (topic alias bounds) among them: no parsing after the
# connection was closed, Remaining Length read as a variable byte integer
# everywhere and checked, unknown requests skipped, no endless wait on a bad
# message, no overflow while rejecting a too-long length, PINGRESP not
# counted below zero.
#
# The commits of the 6.12 branch of https://github.com/qt/qtmqtt, in order
# (all carry Pick-to: 6.8; qtmqtt has no published 6.8 diff for most):
#   f5f164e7b3 86544d2644 c662f644fd eea36a1e4c 469368abbc 514890bd67 1556fcfaef 88430cff7a
# Applies to pristine Qt 6.8.5.
